sigma }^{2},$ and\n\n- ${\\overset{^}{\\sigma }}^{2}={s}^{2}$ denotes an unbiased estimate of ${\\sigma }^{2}$ that's computed from the sample ${x}_{1},{x}_{2},…,{x}_{n}.$\n\nHere, there are $n=51$ data points in the sample, and we have\n\n$$\n\\overset{―}{{x}^{2}}-{(\\overset{―}{x})}^{2}=2.5.\n$$\n\nTherefore, an unbiased estimate of the population variance is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\overset{^}{\\sigma }}^{2} & ={s}^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{n}{n-1}[\\overset{―}{{x}^{2}}-{(\\overset{―}{x})}^{2}] \\\\  & =\\frac{51}{51-1}\\cdot 2.5 \\\\  & =\\frac{127.5}{50} \\\\  & =2.55.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-36f4ea1c-f33d-54d6-8889-bd4ea0379e18"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-36f4ea1c-f33d-54d6-8889-bd4ea0379e18" :answer-field/id #uuid "36f4ea1c-f33d-54d6-8889-bd4ea0379e18" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-5b23c34b-b69a-57c5-b7e6-fd2318116de7" :answer-field/choices ["answer-b44643ad-4dc5-5500-9ce5-ee71edf17395" "answer-c69748ac-f398-5d94-96ca-00128cc3c702" "answer-5b23c34b-b69a-57c5-b7e6-fd2318116de7" "answer-4a233216-fa1d-56d4-9e2b-16a571302e53" "answer-28bebf10-4736-5d5b-991d-68bf2ddce06d"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-b44643ad-4dc5-5500-9ce5-ee71edf17395" :answer/id #uuid "b44643ad-4dc5-5500-9ce5-ee71edf17395" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2.2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c69748ac-f398-5d94-96ca-00128cc3c702" :answer/id #uuid "c69748ac-f398-5d94-96ca-00128cc3c702" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2.25" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-5b23c34b-b69a-57c5-b7e6-fd2318116de7" :answer/id #uuid "5b23c34b-b69a-57c5-b7e6-fd2318116de7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2.55" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-4a233216-fa1d-56d4-9e2b-16a571302e53" :answer/id #uuid "4a233216-fa1d-56d4-9e2b-16a571302e53" :ans